Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.03,0:00:06.12,Default,San,0,0,0,,I'm Isogai Sanako, 17 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:08.99,Default,San,0,0,0,,Your brother always takes good care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.95,0:00:13.83,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Have we met somewhere before?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.83,0:00:18.21,Default,San,0,0,0,,It is a small city, so we may have passed each other on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.92,0:00:20.34,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,You're really beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.34,0:00:22.51,Default,San,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.34,0:00:27.09,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,You're so beautiful, yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.59,0:00:29.43,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Yet Onii-chan has...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.43,0:00:30.81,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.81,0:00:32.18,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.18,0:00:36.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Good. Mei-chan didn't figure out that she's Sanae-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.18,0:00:35.06,Default-alt,Sun,0,0,0,,Get off! Get off of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.06,0:00:37.90,Default-alt,Sun,0,0,0,,Please, I'm begging you, so get off of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.31,0:00:37.90,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm surprised, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.23,0:00:42.03,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I couldn't tell she was my mom for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.23,0:00:40.07,Default-alt,Sun,0,0,0,,Hey, there's a ghost right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.07,0:00:42.03,Default-alt,Sun,0,0,0,,I'll tell our mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:04.67,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}The hill you once walked down...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:04.67,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf24}ki{\kf23}mi {\kf20}da{\kf22}ke {\kf33}ga {\kf32}su{\kf19}gi{\kf27}sa{\kf19}t{\kf39}ta {\kf48}sa{\kf43}ka {\kf42}no {\kf39}to{\kf24}chu{\kf29}u {\kf75}wa
