Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.30,0:01:15.52,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I'm standing here alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.30,0:01:15.52,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf27}bo{\kf21}ku {\kf40}hi{\kf45}to{\kf43}ri {\kf85}ga {\kf24}ko{\kf22}ko {\kf43}de {\kf35}ya{\kf41}sa{\kf41}shi{\kf55}i
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.52,0:01:23.19,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}remembering all the heart-warming memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.52,0:01:23.19,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf21}a{\kf21}ta{\kf44}ta{\kf35}ka{\kf55}sa {\kf80}wo {\kf19}o{\kf27}mo{\kf44}i {\kf45}ka{\kf34}e{\kf96}shi{\kf24}te{\kf190}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.19,0:01:30.86,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,0)}You were the one... You were the one...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.19,0:01:30.86,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,0)}{\kf45}ki{\kf47}mi {\kf61}da{\kf65}ke {\kf197}wo  {\kf24}ki{\kf65}mi {\kf61}da{\kf26}ke {\kf176}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.86,0:01:37.09,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...who I loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.86,0:01:37.09,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf78}su{\kf67}ki {\kf214}de {\kf65}i{\kf65}ta{\kf129}yo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.09,0:01:44.84,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}My eyes start to water from the wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.09,0:01:44.84,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf44}ka{\kf43}ze {\kf64}de {\kf62}me {\kf211}ga {\kf71}ni{\kf67}ji{\kf26}n{\kf185}de
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.84,0:01:51.80,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}and you become a distant figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.84,0:01:51.80,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf89}to{\kf44}o{\kf201}ku {\kf84}na{\kf59}ru {\kf219}yo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.80,0:01:54.10,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I will always remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.80,0:01:54.10,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf14}i{\kf28}tsu{\kf23}ma{\kf21}de{\kf22}mo {\kf14}o{\kf26}bo{\kf25}e{\kf23}te{\kf20}ru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.93,0:01:56.22,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...no matter the changes.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.93,0:01:56.22,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf22}na{\kf18}ni{\kf21}mo {\kf26}ka{\kf21}mo {\kf27}ka{\kf18}wa{\kf19}t{\kf22}te{\kf19}mo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.09,0:01:58.43,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Just this one thing, this one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.09,0:01:58.43,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf19}hi{\kf19}to{\kf26}tsu {\kf20}da{\kf19}ke {\kf23}hi{\kf19}to{\kf24}tsu {\kf23}da{\kf20}ke
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.21,0:02:00.94,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}though it's a plain thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.21,0:02:00.94,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf24}a{\kf23}ri{\kf20}fu{\kf23}re{\kf19}ta {\kf18}mo{\kf21}no {\kf21}da{\kf29}ke{\kf40}do
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.61,0:02:04.90,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}I will show it to you, this one thing covered in glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.61,0:02:04.90,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf25}mi{\kf18}se{\kf25}te {\kf22}ya{\kf19}ru {\kf18}ka{\kf21}ga{\kf23}ya{\kf23}ki {\kf20}ni {\kf17}mi{\kf26}chi{\kf14}ta {\kf27}so{\kf26}no {\kf15}hi{\kf23}to{\kf28}tsu {\kf22}da{\kf16}ke
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.90,0:02:10.15,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}Forever and ever, I shall hold it dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.90,0:02:10.15,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}{\kf19}i{\kf28}tsu{\kf21}ma{\kf27}de{\kf17}mo {\kf14}i{\kf32}tsu{\kf19}ma{\kf21}de{\kf17}mo {\kf23}ma{\kf23}mo{\kf22}t{\kf16}te {\kf27}i{\kf200}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.28,0:02:15.33,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I still think I've met her somewhere before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.33,0:02:16.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's your imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.91,0:02:20.21,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Where do you think Sunohara-san is headed to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.21,0:02:22.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Maybe some food to start out?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.29,0:02:25.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But does he know any classy restaurants?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.50,0:02:28.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey Nagisa. Do you remember what's around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.51,0:02:31.59,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No... I'm sorry, I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.59,0:02:35.18,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Sa-Sanako-san. Would you be hungry at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.18,0:02:36.35,Default,San,0,0,0,,Yes, a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.35,0:02:40.85,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Then there's a place I go to a lot.\NHow about we start by filling our stomachs?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.35,0:02:43.98,Default,San,0,0,0,,That sounds good. Take me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.98,0:02:46.07,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,This is the place I visit regularly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.28,0:02:49.82,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It's a really nice place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.82,0:02:51.07,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Onii-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.45,0:02:53.78,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,My recommendation is the pork cutlet bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.78,0:02:55.91,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I eat it like three times a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.91,0:03:00.46,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It's an expensive store,\Nso average students stay away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.46,0:03:01.75,Default,San,0,0,0,,Youhei-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.75,0:03:04.59,Default,San,0,0,0,,You regularly eat here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:06.21,Default,San,0,0,0,,And only pork cutlet bowls?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.21,0:03:09.46,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Someone like me can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.84,0:03:17.51,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\pos(960,410.000015)\3c&H4A8A5C&}Episode 3
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.84,0:03:17.51,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}Disagreeing Hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.51,0:03:19.60,Default,San,0,0,0,,It's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:21.10,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.10,0:03:23.02,Default,All,0,0,0,,Itadakimasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.48,0:03:25.11,Default,All,0,0,0,,Thank you for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.11,0:03:27.77,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,It was delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.77,0:03:30.86,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,But the flavoring tasted familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.86,0:03:34.24,Default,San,0,0,0,,Eating only pork cutlet bowls is an unbalanced diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.24,0:03:36.78,Default,San,0,0,0,,Please try cooking for yourself from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.78,0:03:37.37,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.37,0:03:40.33,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,You're really kind, Sanako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.33,0:03:45.46,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,You're so kind, yet Onii-chan has...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.46,0:03:47.54,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.54,0:03:49.92,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Would you stop that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.51,0:03:56.97,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Where could they be going next?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.97,0:04:00.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I bet to a movie or shopping.\NOne of those standard activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.18,0:04:04.94,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Yeah. Who would want to be taken to an arcade right off the bat, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.40,0:04:11.94,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,This is horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.94,0:04:12.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.99,0:04:16.24,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sunohara-san's really into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.66,0:04:23.16,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fs108\c&H45F0F2&\b1\pos(960,363)}You lose!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:27.50,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What's wrong with this thing? I bet it's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.29,0:04:30.55,Default,San,0,0,0,,You can't do that, Youhei-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.55,0:04:32.46,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Let's get out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.46,0:04:34.55,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Let's go to a CD store next.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.01,0:04:36.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,His taste in music is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.72,0:04:39.26,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,It's horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.26,0:04:43.18,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Look, I found it. It's my favorite group.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.73,0:04:46.40,Default,San,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.56,0:04:49.27,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.94,0:04:53.49,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,He's completely hopeless today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.24,0:04:56.32,Default,San,0,0,0,,It's getting a little dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:58.16,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,The night's just starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.16,0:05:00.33,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Let's go to a place that has some great scenery!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.33,0:05:03.00,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,He still wants to take her around?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.20,0:05:07.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Shouldn't Sanae-san head home soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:10.92,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. We need to start preparing dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.13,0:05:11.30,Default-alt,Kids,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.92,0:05:12.71,Default,Kids,0,0,0,,You're in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.13,0:05:14.63,Default-alt,Kids,0,0,0,,We can't play, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.63,0:05:15.05,Default,Kids,0,0,0,,I'm not moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.05,0:05:16.68,Default,Kids,0,0,0,,I said get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.68,0:05:18.30,Default,Kids,0,0,0,,You're in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:20.18,Default,Kids,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.18,0:05:21.60,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Does it bother you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.60,0:05:22.22,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.22,0:05:24.10,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'll go stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:25.18,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Please wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.60,0:05:29.06,Default,San,0,0,0,,I'll go stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.06,0:05:30.52,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.52,0:05:31.11,Default,San,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:34.07,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,That's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.07,0:05:37.07,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Kids grow up through fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.07,0:05:38.82,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Onii-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.49,0:05:41.91,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.41,0:05:45.16,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Don't pick on my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.34,0:05:56.92,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Looks like the matter's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:05:58.80,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Shall we move on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:06:02.35,Default,San,0,0,0,,But um... Something looks wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.43,0:06:05.35,Default,San,0,0,0,,Would you wait here for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.15,0:06:15.40,Default,San,0,0,0,,It seems they left home on an errand but got lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.94,0:06:21.41,Default,San,0,0,0,,While the brother was looking for the way home, the sister was bullied by those boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.41,0:06:23.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Lost children, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.12,0:06:26.79,Default,San,0,0,0,,I want to find their house for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.41,0:06:29.92,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It's fine. They'll find their own way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.92,0:06:31.42,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.42,0:06:32.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Come on now...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.42,0:06:37.76,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,We should ask their names first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.76,0:06:39.01,Default,San,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:41.43,Default,San,0,0,0,,What are your names?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.68,0:06:45.47,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,She has a name tag on her clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.52,0:06:49.68,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Great! There's an address written on the back, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:51.69,Default,San,0,0,0,,This isn't far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.69,0:06:53.44,Default,San,0,0,0,,Shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.82,0:06:57.28,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Aren't you glad you can go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.70,0:07:07.33,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I'm glad it was closer than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.33,0:07:07.95,Default,San,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.95,0:07:11.12,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Their parents looked really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.87,0:07:15.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why don't you stop with the attitude and come up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.13,0:07:18.34,Default,San,0,0,0,,Are you upset with me, Youhei-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.76,0:07:20.67,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,No. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.67,0:07:22.72,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It was {\i1}our{\i0} date.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.72,0:07:25.30,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Onii-chan, you're still saying something like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.68,0:07:30.02,Default,San,0,0,0,,Youhei-kun. Please don't be so upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.73,0:07:34.10,Default,San,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, I'd like to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:34.86,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.40,0:07:40.61,Default,San,0,0,0,,It makes me happy that you feel the time we spend together is so important.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.61,0:07:43.66,Default,San,0,0,0,,But at times, there are things that are more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.28,0:07:46.87,Default,San,0,0,0,,Please don't lose sight of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.70,0:07:51.25,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.88,0:08:00.51,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hello, Okazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:03.47,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,And a toilet seat cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.47,0:08:05.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You sound really cheerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.59,0:08:07.30,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Let's go get food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.30,0:08:09.26,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Oh, and a toilet seat cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.26,0:08:10.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll only get food, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.60,0:08:13.48,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'll have a pork cutlet bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.48,0:08:15.56,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,And a toilet seat cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.56,0:08:17.48,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You'll upset your stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.48,0:08:21.53,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Oh, but Sanae-san told me to watch my diet, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.53,0:08:23.49,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,And a toilet seat cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.86,0:08:28.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Mei-chan was worried about you last night, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.99,0:08:33.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She said you didn't change despite finding such a nice girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.96,0:08:38.96,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yeah, I should think things over\Nfor Sanae-san's sake, too, like my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.96,0:08:40.50,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,And a toilet seat cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:43.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're thinking about such a thing for Sanae-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.97,0:08:47.26,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,When I was a kid, I had so many things I wanted to become.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.26,0:08:48.64,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,A soccer player.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.10,0:08:50.89,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,A pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.89,0:08:52.35,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.35,0:08:53.14,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,A teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.14,0:08:54.56,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Stunning!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.56,0:08:55.73,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.65,0:08:59.23,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,...a toilet seat cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.23,0:09:01.98,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,They all sound difficult to become.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.40,0:09:04.82,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I can't keep doing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.82,0:09:08.03,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Just adding "and a toilet seat cover"\Nat the end ruins any kind of serious talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.41,0:09:10.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then quit doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.87,0:09:13.91,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You're the one who told me to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:14.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.37,0:09:18.50,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Well, I won't get mad at you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.29,0:09:21.63,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,A guy in love has a forgiving heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.63,0:09:23.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're in a really good mood, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.13,0:09:24.67,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.67,0:09:27.13,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,She's supposed to call me after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.13,0:09:30.97,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It must be that she seriously fell in love with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.97,0:09:34.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sunohara. Why don't you think about Mei-chan a-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.02,0:09:37.64,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,If I get married to Sanae-san and you to Nagisa-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.81,0:09:39.44,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,that'd make us brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.81,0:09:42.15,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I look forward to that day, my younger brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.74,0:09:46.32,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.28,0:09:51.07,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Maybe it had the wrong effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.07,0:09:52.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.49,0:09:54.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That idiot's totally out of his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.33,0:10:02.04,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Mei-chan. Are you waiting for Sunohara-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.04,0:10:04.75,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Yes. You're not with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.75,0:10:06.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He went home already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.72,0:10:09.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He says he shouldn't miss his girl's call.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.34,0:10:12.10,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Gosh, he's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.18,0:10:17.73,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Would you not bother me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.73,0:10:19.44,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sunohara-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.44,0:10:24.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey! Your sister came all the way to check on you. You shouldn't be saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.61,0:10:28.70,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,When in midst of love, sisters fall out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.70,0:10:31.07,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Love is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.57,0:10:35.79,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Rather than that, Mei, shouldn't you go home soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:38.08,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I'm not going home yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.46,0:10:40.92,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,There's something I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.92,0:10:43.00,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Something you have to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.29,0:10:45.00,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Ah, I gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.46,0:10:47.26,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What could they be talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.26,0:10:52.51,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,So basically, checking up on me\Nwas just an excuse to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.51,0:10:56.81,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,She's always loved the city,\Nso she wanted to spend some time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.18,0:10:57.85,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.77,0:11:01.65,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.65,0:11:02.73,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.73,0:11:04.40,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,But that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.15,0:11:07.90,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,The person I like is here, so I came to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.53,0:11:10.24,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,P-Person you like?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.78,0:11:13.32,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Someone I met the last time I was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.32,0:11:16.16,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,He's really mature and teaches me all sorts of fun things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.53,0:11:18.24,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,And he's kind, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.24,0:11:21.12,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,He says I'm cute, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.21,0:11:21.92,Default-alt,Sun,0,0,0,,Hold on, Mei. {ep 2}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.92,0:11:24.88,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Love is amazing, isn't it, Onii-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.88,0:11:25.71,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.71,0:11:27.30,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Who exactly is the-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.88,0:11:28.88,Default-alt,Mei,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to see him after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:30.17,Default-alt,Mei,0,0,0,,So I have to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.72,0:11:35.76,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Enjoy your time with her. {ep 2}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.06,0:11:38.35,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Mei-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.35,0:11:39.60,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.60,0:11:41.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey! You should go after her, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.69,0:11:45.94,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, but I shouldn't go in case Sanae-san calls. {ep 2}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.94,0:11:48.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are you still saying something like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.11,0:11:50.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What are you going to do if the guy is some scumbag?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.65,0:11:53.07,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,But love is a person's choice. {ep 2}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.96,0:12:06.00,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Onii-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.63,0:12:09.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sorry. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.94,0:12:34.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I understand you're upset with him, but wasn't that a little much?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.61,0:12:38.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What are you going to do now? You're only complicating things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.12,0:12:41.33,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I don't want to see Onii-chan like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.83,0:12:46.04,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I wanted him to come after me\Nand tell me not to go with a guy like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:49.29,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I didn't mind if he hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.29,0:12:51.09,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I was ready for him to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.46,0:12:54.30,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I wanted him to yell at me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.93,0:13:03.52,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,When I was little, I was picked on by boys in our neighborhood all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.89,0:13:07.81,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,But Onii-chan was always there to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.31,0:13:12.57,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,When I cried, Onii-chan would always come running to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:15.45,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Saying, "Stop making Mei cry!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.03,0:13:20.83,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,It made me really happy and was reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.25,0:13:29.96,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,After starting middle school,\Nhe started to become really good at soccer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.54,0:13:34.76,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,He was counted on not only by me, but by everyone in the team, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.55,0:13:38.34,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,He's not the brother I used to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.84,0:13:43.01,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,He wouldn't have kept his mouth shut after seeing a girl picked on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.01,0:13:45.93,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,He's supposed to worry about me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.85,0:13:51.44,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san. That girlfriend of Onii-chan's was a fake, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.86,0:13:54.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, we knew you'd figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.36,0:13:58.45,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,The one who played the role of his girlfriend was my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.07,0:14:01.49,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sorry we lied to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.99,0:14:03.24,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I knew it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.74,0:14:07.37,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Gosh, he's so hopeless...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:10.17,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Causing so much trouble for everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.17,0:14:12.29,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No, we never thought of him like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.26,0:14:16.84,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,He's so hopeless...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.80,0:14:23.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're going on a date with Sunohara again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.97,0:14:27.48,Default,San,0,0,0,,Yes. To make up for the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.48,0:14:31.06,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I don't think there's a need to go in disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.15,0:14:35.65,Default,San,0,0,0,,I've come to like this outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.23,0:14:38.19,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you all doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.15,0:14:40.03,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,S-Sanae?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.03,0:14:44.41,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Dad, you're amazing! You knew this was Mom instantly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.41,0:14:46.29,Default,San,0,0,0,,Akio-san, this is for-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.29,0:14:47.50,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:49.54,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Shh! It's a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:53.21,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,What? What are you guys planning on doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.21,0:14:55.50,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,We were practicing theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.50,0:14:56.46,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Theater?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.46,0:14:57.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.80,0:15:01.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We wanted Sanae-san to help out with the practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.56,0:15:10.02,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,But man, they're all girls' clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.02,0:15:13.48,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sanae-san, please go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.73,0:15:12.44,Default-alt,Aki,0,0,0,,What kind of play is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.69,0:15:16.02,Default-alt,Nag,0,0,0,,We're still in the process of coming up with the plot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.48,0:15:14.52,Default,San,0,0,0,,Excuse me then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.61,0:15:20.40,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Where did Sanae go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.40,0:15:23.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She probably ran away in embarrassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.16,0:15:26.49,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,She's cute no matter how old she gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.49,0:15:28.70,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,So, what's the story going to be like this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.83,0:15:32.37,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa's the one coming up with the plot again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.37,0:15:35.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sounds like she's hit a wall,\Nso would you give her some advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.84,0:15:38.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We'll go look for Sanae-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.59,0:15:40.01,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.51,0:15:45.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,They weren't meeting here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.55,0:15:48.14,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I didn't hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.14,0:15:50.81,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I was planning on following Sanae-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.64,0:15:55.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure we can leave Sanae-san alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.65,0:15:57.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How about we go hang out somewhere, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.36,0:16:02.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If you only worry about Sunohara, it'll tire you out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.24,0:16:12.08,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.08,0:16:13.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It'd probably look good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:17.38,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I wish you were really my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.38,0:16:19.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you really mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.38,0:16:20.76,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.76,0:16:23.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then try treating me like I'm your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.34,0:16:25.01,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Like you're my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.34,0:16:26.47,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.47,0:16:28.22,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Hey, Onii-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.97,0:16:30.97,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Onii-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.97,0:16:32.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,N-Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.64,0:16:34.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That was more effective than I'd thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.56,0:16:37.56,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,What are you saying? You're so weird, Onii-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.06,0:16:39.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.94,0:16:43.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No more "Onii-chan"!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.49,0:16:47.41,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Why? I can't call you "Onii-chan", Onii-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.41,0:16:49.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Actually, don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.12,0:16:55.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.75,0:16:56.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Since when?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.58,0:17:00.63,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,He's making Mei-chan call him "Onii-chan".
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.63,0:17:01.84,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,He's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.84,0:17:03.84,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,He looked really turned on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.84,0:17:05.76,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Oka... Okazaki-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.76,0:17:07.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No. There's a reason behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:10.26,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,We didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.26,0:17:11.35,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You'll infect us with your idiocy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.35,0:17:12.35,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.35,0:17:13.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You got it wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.47,0:17:15.18,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.48,0:17:15.18,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.18,0:17:16.52,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Don't follow us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.06,0:17:18.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No more "Onii-chan" after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.69,0:17:21.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Actually, I take that back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.53,0:17:26.53,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Onii-chan. What should Mei do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.53,0:17:28.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No more!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.03,0:17:31.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I forbid it!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.37,0:17:34.87,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Wow! There are so many to choose from!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.87,0:17:37.21,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,The city is amazing after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.21,0:17:39.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This isn't really a city, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.13,0:17:41.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Want me to treat you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.29,0:17:42.71,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.71,0:17:45.21,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Then I'll have...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.67,0:17:46.88,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,This one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.88,0:17:49.18,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like this before!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.59,0:17:51.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Princess Crepe?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.39,0:17:53.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She's right, I've never seen anything like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.51,0:17:56.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, the price is princess-like, too.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:53.91,0:17:56.68,Signs,Oka,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\b1\blur1\an5\fnArial Rounded MT Bold\fs54\c&HBBB0FF&\frz1.919\move(1404,726,1419,715.5,0,214)\2c&HAFAFE9&}Princess \NCrepe
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.14,0:17:58.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Girls are unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.69,0:18:00.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How about something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.10,0:18:02.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How about the Maharajah Crepe-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.77,0:18:02.98,Default-alt,Mei,0,0,0,,Onii-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.98,0:18:06.44,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Mei wants to have the Princess Crepe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.99,0:18:12.28,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.83,0:18:13.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm such a...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.87,0:18:15.75,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Do you want to try some, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.75,0:18:17.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then I'll take a bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:25.13,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,You took the strawberry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.13,0:18:27.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You said I can try some.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.72,0:18:29.63,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I hate you, Onii-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.63,0:18:32.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No! Don't hate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.51,0:18:34.97,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Then can we do that together?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.97,0:18:37.98,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Then I'll forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.98,0:18:40.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're kidding. That's so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.02,0:18:42.48,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Strawberry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.27,0:18:42.48,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,Okay, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.48,0:18:44.40,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Maybe it's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.90,0:18:45.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.69,0:18:48.24,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,This is so exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.24,0:18:50.11,Default,Voice,0,0,0,,Choose a frame you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.11,0:18:51.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Which one do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.45,0:18:53.78,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,This one!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.78,0:18:54.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.66,0:18:57.87,Default,Voice,0,0,0,,We'll now take the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.87,0:18:58.45,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.45,0:18:59.50,Default,Voice,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.96,0:19:01.71,Default,Voice,0,0,0,,Say "Cheese!"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.51,0:19:10.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This is really embarrassing, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.63,0:19:13.18,Default-alt,Mei,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san! Make sure you put it on your student ID!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.47,0:19:14.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.48,0:19:22.48,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.73,0:19:26.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Where've you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.07,0:19:27.78,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I was meeting my girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.78,0:19:29.74,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What were you two doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.74,0:19:31.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We were looking for-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.70,0:19:32.70,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.16,0:19:37.66,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.66,0:19:39.91,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,It's none of your business!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.91,0:19:41.21,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.21,0:19:44.17,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Man, looks like the truth has come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.13,0:19:47.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's just as you imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.25,0:19:50.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Mei-chan's boyfriend turns out to be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.55,0:19:52.88,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What happened to Nagisa-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.88,0:19:55.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Obviously, I'm breaking up with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.26,0:19:59.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The truth is, Mei-chan actually stayed over at my place last night, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.47,0:20:00.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Right, Mei?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.47,0:20:05.15,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah. I was alone with Okazaki-san, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.52,0:20:11.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Shall we get a move on, Mei?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.07,0:20:11.90,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.61,0:20:15.36,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.53,0:20:19.49,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I said wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.01,0:20:33.93,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Why does it have to turn out like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.51,0:20:38.51,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.49,0:21:00.83,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,And nothing more?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.83,0:21:04.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I tried to pull off an act thinking we'd make him worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:07.33,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, all for our sake...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.33,0:21:08.17,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.54,0:21:12.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But even with all the provocation, he didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.71,0:21:17.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was hoping he'd show his "reliable brother" side.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.22,0:21:23.22,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,It looks like he doesn't care about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.22,0:21:25.27,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,That can't be true!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.69,0:21:28.48,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But, lying is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.19,0:21:32.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Mei-chan, shouldn't you go home soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.44,0:21:34.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You've been absent from school a whole week.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.19,0:21:36.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Your parents must be worried about you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.36,0:21:38.36,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I can't go home leaving things the way they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.36,0:21:40.74,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Not until Onii-chan gets his act together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.16,0:21:43.20,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.20,0:21:47.71,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I want Onii-chan to play soccer again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.71,0:21:52.46,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,If he plays soccer again, maybe he'll return to the way he used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.96,0:21:55.34,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,If possible, he should return to the Soccer Team and...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.84,0:21:57.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I think that's difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.43,0:22:02.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You know what happened between Sunohara and the Soccer Team, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.72,0:22:06.18,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,But I think that's our only chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.89,0:22:09.85,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(1459.999969,840)\bord0.75\3c&H000000&\blur0.5}To be continued
