Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.86,0:23:43.82,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs99.999996\fad(0,400)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,470.000015)\blur0.5\bord0.75\3c&H000000&}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.82,0:23:43.32,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'm busy taking care of matters with Sanae-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.32,0:23:45.62,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I don't have time to worry about Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.33,0:23:48.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Mei-chan, let's think it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.62,0:23:56.46,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,He has many good traits but just can't express them well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.76,0:24:09.72,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,405)\bord0.75\blur0.5\3c&H00000A&}Episode 4
